```"},{"name":"mcp__codex_apps__linear_get_diff_threads","description":"Plan and build products

Exact lookup for diff threads. Use with review URLs, GitHub PR URLs, Linear full identifiers, UUIDs, or slugs. This tool is part of plugin `Linear`.

exec tool declaration:
